OL,3,ARussell Brand's wife says she'll honour
OL,4,Aprison rules after message row         
OL,6,FThe wife of disgraced comedian Russell 
OL,7,FBrand says she will "honour" the rules 
OL,8,Fof his prison, a week after she read a 
OL,9,Fmessage from her husband proclaiming   
OL,10,Fhis innocence.                         
OL,12,FLaura Brand, 39, drew criticism from   
OL,13,Fministers after reading out the message
OL,14,Ffrom inside HMP Littlehey last week,   
OL,15,Fprompting the government to seek to    
OL,16,Fhave the episode removed from social   
OL,17,Fmedia platforms.                       
OL,23,APub: 22-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2 
OL,24,ANext PageBCultureC Nat RadioFTechnology
